k rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/typicons/2.0.9/typicons.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.min.css"></head><body><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-md py-3"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="#"><h1>OpenDyslexic</h1></a><button class="navbar-toggler" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navcol-1"><span class="visually-hidden">Toggle navigation</span><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navcol-1"><ul class="navbar-nav me-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="index.html">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="about.html">About</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="related-research.html">Related Research</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="patreons.html">Patreons</a></li></ul><a class="btn btn-primary" role="button" href="https://antijingoist.itch.io/opendyslexic">Download</a></div></div></nav><section class="text-white py-4 py-xl-5"><section><div style="height: 600px;background: url(&quot;assets/img/banfff.jpg&quot;) center / cover, #2d5473;"><section class="py-4 py-xl-5"><div class="container h-100"><div class="row h-100"><div class="col-md-10 col-xl-8 text-center d-flex d-sm-flex d-md-flex justify-content-center align-items-center justify-content-md-start align-items-md-center justify-content-xl-center mx-auto"><div><h2 class="text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3">OpenDyslexic: A typeface for Dyslexia</h2><p class="mb-4">OpenDyslexic is a typeface designed against some common symptoms of dyslexia. If you like the way you are able to read this page, and others, then this typeface is for you!<br><br>OpenDyslexic is free to use: The newest version of OpenDyslexic now uses the SIL-OFL license, giving you freedom to use it for personal use, business use, education, commercial, books, ebook readers, applications, websites, and any other project or purpose you need.<br><br><br><a class="btn btn-success fs-5 me-2 px-4 py-2" role="button" href="https://antijingoist.itch.io/opendyslexic">Download</a><br></p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="container position-relative h-100" style="top: -50px;"><div class="row gy-5 gy-lg-0 row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3"><div class="col"><div class="card"><div class="card-body p-4 pt-5"><div class="position-absolute d-flex flex-shrink-0 justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3 bs-icon-lg bs-icon-rounded bs-icon-primary bs-icon lg" style="top:-30px;"><i class="typcn typcn-download"></i></div><h3 class="card-title">Use OpenDyslexic for Free</h3><p class="card-text">Donations are optional, but definitely appreciated. <br><br>You can download and use OpenDyslexic for free. There are no mandatory fees.<br><br>You can donate any amount when you download OpenDyslexic from Itch.io. <br><br>You can also subscribe to the Patreon which helps pay for ongoing costs that keep this going.<br><br>If you wish to donate another way, send an email to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#f88b8d8888978a8cb8999a9a919d9b979cd69d8b"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f4878184849b8680b49596969d91979b90da9187">[email&#160;protected]</span>.</a></p></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-body p-4 pt-5"><div class="position-absolute d-flex flex-shrink-0 justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3 bs-icon-lg bs-icon-rounded bs-icon-primary bs-icon lg" style="top:-30px;"><i class="typcn typcn-messages"></i></div><h3 class="card-title">Contact / Socials</h3><p>Social: <a href="https://masto.hackers.town/@antijingoist" rel="me">Mastodon</a></p><p>Support:&nbsp;<br><span style="color:rgba(var(--bs-link-color-rgb),var(--bs-link-opacity,1));"><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="e3909693938c9197a38281818a86808c87cd8690">[email&#160;protected]</a></span></p><p>website: <a href="https://abbiegonzalez.com">abbiegonzalez.com</a></p></div></div></div><div class="col"><div class="card"><div class="card-body p-4 pt-5"><div class="position-absolute d-flex flex-shrink-0 justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3 bs-icon-lg bs-icon-rounded bs-icon-primary bs-icon lg" style="top:-30px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
