                    </svg></div><h3 class="card-title">Donate</h3><p class="card-text">Subscribe to help cover continuing costs on Patreon, or send a one-time donation over Itch.io</p><a class="btn btn-primary" role="button" href="https://patreon.com/opendyslexic">Patreon</a><a class="btn btn-primary" role="button" href="https://antijingoist.itch.io/opendyslexic">Itch.io</a></div></div><div class="card"><div class="card-body p-4 pt-5"><div class="position-absolute d-flex flex-shrink-0 justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3 bs-icon-lg bs-icon-rounded bs-icon-primary bs-icon lg" style="top:-30px;"><i class="typcn typcn-pencil"></i></div><h3 class="card-title">Contribute</h3><p class="card-text">Want to help work on OpenDyslexic? Work on OpenDyslexic is done using Glyphs.app, and the source is hosted on the Hackers.town Forgejo instance.</p><p><a href="https://forge.hackers.town/antijingoist/opendyslexic">Help by sharing bugs or requests.</a></p></div></div></div><div class="col"><div class="card"><div class="card-body p-4 pt-5"><div class="position-absolute d-flex flex-shrink-0 justify-content-center align-items-center mb-3 bs-icon-lg bs-icon-rounded bs-icon-primary bs-icon lg" style="top:-30px;"><i class="typcn typcn-news"></i></div><h3 class="card-title">Recent News</h3><ul>
